'''Jade Bows''' are the [[ranger]] [[construct]]s created by the [[Mursaat]] to serve them as personal guard. They are similar to [[Jade Armor]]. In the original campaign, they always use [[Hornbow (Mursaat)|Mursaat skin Hornbows]], but during the [[War in Kryta]], they use [[The Adjudicator]], a re-[[skin]] of that weapon that more closely matches their color scheme.

